  <entry>
    <title>基于hexo架构fluid渲染</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/12/hexo_and_fluid/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/12/hexo_and_fluid/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="一、前期准备"><a href="#一、前期准备" class="headerlink" title="一、前期准备"></a>一、前期准备</h1><h2 id="1-Git-for-Windows安装与配置"><a href="#1-Git-for-Windows安装与配置" class="headerlink" title="1.Git for Windows安装与配置"></a>1.Git for Windows安装与配置</h2><h3 id="1-1下载"><a href="#1-1下载" class="headerlink" title="1.1下载"></a>1.1下载</h3><p>官网下载地址：<a href="https://git-scm.com/downloads">https://git-scm.com/downloads</a></p><p>根据自己电脑系统下载安装包（大部分都是windows64位）：<br><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/1.gitforwindows01.png?raw=true" alt="gitforwindows1"></p><p>双击安装包，进入安装导向界面（<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/xhmico/article/details/144647520">git安装参考</a>)<br><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/2.gitforwindows02.png?raw=true" alt="git_exe"></p><p>可以通过查看git版本号验证是否安装成功：</p><figure class="highlight ada"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ada">git <span class="hljs-comment">--version</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/3.gitforwindows03.png?raw=true" alt="alt text"></p><h3 id="1-2本地配置"><a href="#1-2本地配置" class="headerlink" title="1.2本地配置"></a>1.2本地配置</h3><p>打开<strong>Git Bash</strong>，配置你的 Git 身份信息（换成自己的 GitHub 用户名、注册邮箱）：</p><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">git config <span class="hljs-attr">--global</span> user<span class="hljs-selector-class">.name</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你的GitHub用户名&quot;</span><br>git config <span class="hljs-attr">--global</span> user<span class="hljs-selector-class">.email</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你的GitHub注册邮箱&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><font color="#f77284">如果你的 Windows 用户名是中文，后续所有博客文件夹全部放在 D 盘纯英文路径，不要放 C 盘用户目录。</font></p><h2 id="2-node-js安装"><a href="#2-node-js安装" class="headerlink" title="2.node.js安装"></a>2.node.js安装</h2><p>检查本地是否安装：<strong>win+r</strong> 输入 <strong>cmd</strong> ，打开终端输入以下指令:</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">node --version<br>npm --version<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/4.hexo_node.png?raw=true" alt="hexo_node"></p><p>关于 Node.js 的安装可参考博客：<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/xhmico/article/details/159132633">Node.js 与 npm 的安装与配置（详细教</a></p><h2 id="3-配置-SSH-密钥：实现免密推送"><a href="#3-配置-SSH-密钥：实现免密推送" class="headerlink" title="3.配置 SSH 密钥：实现免密推送"></a>3.配置 SSH 密钥：实现免密推送</h2><p>配置 SSH 密钥后，推送代码到 GitHub 时不需要每次输入密码，是搭建博客的必备步骤。</p><ul><li><p>在 Git Bash 中生成 SSH 密钥</p><figure class="highlight excel"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs excel">ssh-keygen -<span class="hljs-built_in">t</span> <span class="hljs-symbol">ed25519</span> -C <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你的邮箱@example.com&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><font color="#f77284">这里的邮箱是你注册GitHub时用的邮箱</font></p></li><li><p>复制公钥内容</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>在github中配置<br><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/5.git_ssh01.png?raw=true" alt="git-ssh01">  </p><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/6.git_ssh02.png?raw=true" alt="git-ssh02">  </p><p>将从id_ed25519.pub里复制的公钥放入<strong>key</strong>方框中，title可随意命名：<br><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/7.git_ssh03.png?raw=true" alt="git-ssh03"></p></li></ul><p><strong>验证是否成功：</strong></p><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs nginx"><span class="hljs-attribute">ssh</span> -T git<span class="hljs-variable">@github</span>.com<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果最后出现”Hi username!”<br>即表示连接成功。</p><h2 id="4-创建博客专用的-GitHub-仓库"><a href="#4-创建博客专用的-GitHub-仓库" class="headerlink" title="4.创建博客专用的 GitHub 仓库"></a>4.创建博客专用的 GitHub 仓库</h2><p>登录 GitHub 后点击右上角 + 号 → New repository，创建一个特殊命名的仓库：</p><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/8.git_repository.png?raw=true" alt="alt text"><br><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/9.git_repository.png?raw=true" alt="alt text"></p><p> <font color="#f77284">仓库名必须是：你的用户名.github.io</font></p><ul><li>选择 Public（公开），GitHub Pages 免费版要求</li><li>不要勾选 Initialize with README</li><li>不要添加 .gitignore 和 License</li><li>保持空仓库，后面由 Hexo 自动推送</li></ul><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/10.hexo_markdown.png?raw=true" alt="alt text"></p><h1 id="二、创建hexo博客"><a href="#二、创建hexo博客" class="headerlink" title="二、创建hexo博客"></a>二、创建hexo博客</h1><h2 id="1-安装-Hexo-并初始化博客站点"><a href="#1-安装-Hexo-并初始化博客站点" class="headerlink" title="1.安装 Hexo 并初始化博客站点"></a>1.安装 Hexo 并初始化博客站点</h2><ul><li>在<strong>git bash</strong>中，全局安装 Hexo 命令行工具：<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li>创建博客文件夹并初始化：<figure class="highlight perl"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs perl"><span class="hljs-keyword">mkdir</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">my</span>-blog &amp;&amp; cd <span class="hljs-keyword">my</span>-blog<br>hexo init<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li>安装依赖并启动本地预览：<figure class="highlight axapta"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs axapta">npm install<br>hexo <span class="hljs-keyword">server</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure> <font color="#f77284">查看本地：<strong>localhost:4000</strong>，启动后打开浏览器访问上面的地址，<br>就能看到 Hexo 默认主题的博客首页。</font></li></ul><h2 id="2-hexo项目目录结构"><a href="#2-hexo项目目录结构" class="headerlink" title="2.hexo项目目录结构"></a>2.hexo项目目录结构</h2><p>myblog&#x2F;<br><br>├── _config.yml $~~~~~~~~~~$#【站点配置文件，重点修改】<br><br>├── package.json $~~~~~~~$#依赖配置<br><br>├── scaffolds&#x2F;$~~~~~~~~~~~~~$#文章模板<br><br>├── source&#x2F;<br><br>│   └── _posts&#x2F;$~~~~~~~~~~~~~$#✍️写Markdown文章就放在这里<br><br>├── themes&#x2F;$~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~$#🎨主题存放文件夹，Fluid装在这里<br><br>└── public&#x2F;$~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~$#自动生成静态网页，不要手动改</p><h2 id="3-hexo必背四个命令"><a href="#3-hexo必背四个命令" class="headerlink" title="3.hexo必背四个命令"></a>3.hexo必背四个命令</h2><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/11.hexo_command.png?raw=true" alt="hexo_command"></p><h2 id="4-站点配置文件-config-yml"><a href="#4-站点配置文件-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="4.站点配置文件 _config.yml"></a>4.站点配置文件 _config.yml</h2><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-meta"># Site 站点信息</span><br><span class="hljs-symbol">title:</span> 我的博客<br><span class="hljs-symbol">subtitle:</span> 记录技术与生活<br><span class="hljs-symbol">author:</span> 你的名字<br><span class="hljs-symbol">language:</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">zh</span>-CN<br><br><span class="hljs-meta"># URL 博客地址</span><br><span class="hljs-symbol">url:</span> https://用户名.github.io<br><br><span class="hljs-meta"># Deploy 部署配置</span><br><span class="hljs-symbol">deploy:</span><br><span class="hljs-symbol">type:</span> git<br><span class="hljs-symbol">repo:</span> git@github.com:...<br><span class="hljs-symbol">branch:</span> main<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/12.hexo_config01.png?raw=true" alt="hexo_config01"><br><img src="https://github.com/jj977/picture_use/blob/hexo/13.hexo_config02.png?raw=true" alt="hexo_config02"></p><h2 id="5-部署到-GitHub-Pages：让博客上线"><a href="#5-部署到-GitHub-Pages：让博客上线" class="headerlink" title="5.部署到 GitHub Pages：让博客上线"></a>5.部署到 GitHub Pages：让博客上线</h2><ul><li>安装部署插件 hexo-deployer-git<figure class="highlight ada"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ada">npm install hexo-deployer-git <span class="hljs-comment">--save</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li>确认 _config.yml 中 deploy 配置正确<figure class="highlight jboss-cli"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs jboss-cli">  <span class="hljs-keyword">deploy</span>:<br>  type: git<br>  repo: git@github.com:用户名/用户名<span class="hljs-string">.github.io.git</span><br>* 执行部署命令，一键发布上线<br>  hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo generate &amp;&amp; hexo <span class="hljs-keyword">deploy</span><br><br>_验证部署成功：_  <br>  打开浏览器访问，“用户名<span class="hljs-string">.github.io</span>”  <br>   &lt;font color=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;#f77284&quot;</span>&gt;可能需要五到十分钟等待<br>&lt;<span class="hljs-string">/font</span>&gt;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 三、Fluid渲染配置</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 1.下载fluid</span><br><br>* 在**my-blog**目录下，打开git bash，输入以下命令：<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>npm install –save hexo-theme-fluid<figure class="highlight arduino"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs arduino">  然后在博客目录下创建 _config.fluid.yml，将主题的 _config.<span class="hljs-built_in">yml</span> (opens <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> window)内容复制过去。  <br>* 修改**my-blog**目录下的，config.yml文件，修改：language：zn-CN ;theme：fluid：  <br>![alt text](image<span class="hljs-number">-1.</span>png)  <br>![alt text](image<span class="hljs-number">-2.</span>png)  <br><br>* 首次使用主题的「关于页」需要手动创建：<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>hexo new page about<figure class="highlight applescript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs applescript">  创建成功后修改 <span class="hljs-keyword">my</span>-blog/source/<span class="hljs-keyword">about</span>/index.md，添加 layout 属性:  <br>  ![alt <span class="hljs-built_in">text</span>](image<span class="hljs-number">-3.</span>png)    <br><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 2.更新主题</span><br>在**<span class="hljs-keyword">my</span>-blog**目录下，打开git bash，输入以下命令：  <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>npm update –save hexo-theme-fluid</li></ul><pre><code class="hljs"># 四、问题总结</code></pre>]]></content>
    
    
    
